# Irreverent Gremlin: "Whenever another creature you control with power 2 or less enters, you may discard a card. If you do, draw
# a card. Do this only once each turn." (CR 603.2, 603.2h, 701.9, 121.1). Casting the Gremlin does nothing (it is not "another"
# creature to itself). The first Ornithopter on turn 1 offers the discard: Bot1 discards the Island and draws the Forest (the
# library's top card). The second Ornithopter that turn triggers nothing, the once having been done (no question is asked and the
# Gremlin has menace). On turn 3 the once-each-turn is new: the third Ornithopter discards the Forest and draws the Island (the Swamp was the turn-3 draw).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Irreverent Gremlin
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island
Forest
Swamp
Island x12

